              <property>aero/coefficient/CD</property>
          </product>
      </function>
    </axis>
    <axis name="SIDE">
      <function name="aero/force/Side">
          <product>
              <property>aero/qbar-area</property>
              <property>aero/coefficient/CY</property>
          </product>
      </function>
    </axis>
    <axis name="ROLL">
      <function name="aero/moment/Roll">
          <product>
              <property>aero/qbar-area</property>
              <property>metrics/bw-ft</property>
              <property>aero/coefficient/Cl</property>
          </product>
      </function>
    </axis>
    <axis name="PITCH">
      <function name="aero/moment/Pitch">
          <product>
              <property>aero/qbar-area</property>
              <property>metrics/cbarw-ft</property>
              <property>aero/coefficient/Cm</property>
          </product>
      </function>
      <function name="aero/moment/Pitch_propwash_damp">
          <description>Pitch damping from the propeller slipstream over the wing. qbar is built from freestream velocity, ~0 at hover, so the wing's Cemq=-12.14 damping is off exactly at hover while the props' induced flow keeps it active in reality. M = C * Vind_avg[fps] * q with Vind from FGPropeller's momentum-theory induced velocity, as stock c172p and pc7 do; C = 1/4*rho*S*cbar^2*Cemq in English units (S 4.306 ft2, cbar 0.722 ft) = -0.01619. Vind falls with airspeed, so the term fades in cruise and does not double-count the freestream Cemq.</description>
          <product>
              <value>-0.01619</value>
              <property>velocities/q-rad_sec</property>
              <quotient>
                  <sum>
                      <property>propulsion/engine[0]/prop-induced-velocity_fps</property>
                      <property>propulsion/engine[1]/prop-induced-velocity_fps</property>
                      <property>propulsion/engine[2]/prop-induced-velocity_fps</property>
                      <property>propulsion/engine[3]/prop-induced-velocity_fps</property>
                  </sum>
                  <value>4.0</value>
              </quotient>
          </product>
      </function>
    </axis>
    <axis name="YAW">
      <function name="aero/moment/Yaw">
          <product>
              <property>aero/qbar-area</property>
              <property>metrics/bw-ft</property>
              <property>aero/coefficient/Cn</property>
          </product>
      </function>
    </axis>
  </aerodynamics>
